---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SectionTitle from "../components/SectionTitle.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About - FLIPSIGHT"
  description="FLIPSIGHT is an Antwerp-based independent record label and art project founded in 2023 by C. de Boer and F. Lagrange."
>
  <div class="fs-page fs-page-stack">
    <section class="grid items-end gap-8 md:grid-cols-[5fr_6fr]">
      <div>
        <div class="fs-meta">About</div>
        <h1 class="fs-display mt-4 text-[clamp(50px,7vw,118px)]">Records,<br />images,<br />people.</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-6">
        <p class="max-w-xl text-[clamp(18px,2.1vw,28px)] leading-tight text-[var(--fs-ink)]">
          FLIPSIGHT is a small independent record label and art project from Antwerp. It started in 2023 from a shared love for music, records, art and the people around it.
        </p>
        <div class="grid gap-3 border-t fs-soft-rule pt-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--fs-mute)] sm:grid-cols-3">
          <span>Antwerp / 2023</span>
          <span>Vinyl / editions</span>
          <span>Limited runs / real rooms</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <SectionTitle eyebrow="Founded by" title="Two sides of the same record." note="C. de Boer / F. Lagrange" />
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="border-t fs-rule pt-5">
          <div class="fs-meta-muted">The ears</div>
          <h2 class="fs-display mt-3 text-[clamp(28px,3vw,46px)]">C. de Boer</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--fs-ink-2)]">
            Also known as Chris Farmer. Chris brings the music side of FLIPSIGHT: the artists, the selections, the listening, the decisions that turn a track into a release.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="border-t fs-rule pt-5">
          <div class="fs-meta-muted">The eyes</div>
          <h2 class="fs-display mt-3 text-[clamp(28px,3vw,46px)]">F. Lagrange</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--fs-ink-2)]">
            Frederik shapes the visual world: artwork, art direction, the website and the objects around each record. The image is built to belong to the music, not simply decorate it.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr]">
      <div class="border-t fs-rule pt-5">
        <div class="fs-meta">How we work</div>
        <h2 class="fs-display mt-3 text-[clamp(36px,4.8vw,74px)]">Slow enough to care.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-8">
        <p class="max-w-3xl text-[clamp(18px,2vw,26px)] leading-tight text-[var(--fs-ink)]">
          Most FLIPS releases are pressed on vinyl in limited runs of 300 copies. Each one is built together with the artist: listening, talking, testing, refining, then making the sound and the visual identity land in the same place.
        </p>
        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="border-t fs-soft-rule pt-4">
            <div class="fs-meta-muted">01 / Sound</div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--fs-ink-2)]">
              Electronic music selected for feeling, function and detail. Records for home listening, warm-ups and rooms that need a groove.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t fs-soft-rule pt-4">
            <div class="fs-meta-muted">02 / Object</div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--fs-ink-2)]">
              A record is more than a platform link. It is something you can hold, play, look at, file, lend, wear down and keep.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t fs-soft-rule pt-4">
            <div class="fs-meta-muted">03 / Image</div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--fs-ink-2)]">
              Every release gets its own visual language: artwork, catalogue marks, editions, sleeves and fragments that extend the music.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="grid gap-8 border-y fs-rule py-8 md:grid-cols-[4fr_6fr]">
      <div>
        <div class="fs-meta-muted">Beyond releases</div>
        <h2 class="fs-display mt-3 text-[clamp(32px,4vw,58px)]">Into rooms.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-5">
        <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--fs-ink-2)]">
          Next to the records, FLIPSIGHT creates FLIPSART pieces, small editions and events. Label nights, FLIPSIGHT Cafés and vernissages are ways to bring the catalogue off the screen and into real rooms.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--fs-ink-2)]">
          At its core, FLIPSIGHT is simple: good music, strong visuals, real objects and honest collaboration.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-2">
          <a class="fs-meta border fs-soft-rule px-4 py-3 transition-colors hover:border-[var(--fs-ink)] hover:bg-[var(--fs-bg-2)]" href="/music">Music</a>
          <a class="fs-meta border fs-soft-rule px-4 py-3 transition-colors hover:border-[var(--fs-ink)] hover:bg-[var(--fs-bg-2)]" href="/art">FLIPSART</a>
          <a class="fs-meta border fs-soft-rule px-4 py-3 transition-colors hover:border-[var(--fs-ink)] hover:bg-[var(--fs-bg-2)]" href="/events">Events</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
